---
title: MemLink多智能体协作时序图
---
%% 图示说明：展示一次任务从入口到四个 Agent、状态、记忆和指标落盘的真实协作顺序。
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor USER as 用户
    participant ENTRY as CLI / FastAPI / Streamlit
    participant ORCH as Orchestrator
    participant REG as AgentRegistry
    participant PLAN as Planner
    participant RET as Retriever
    participant EXEC as Executor
    participant REV as Reviewer
    participant STATE as SemanticState Store
    participant MEMORY as Shared Memory
    participant LLM as LLM Backend
    participant METRICS as Metrics

    USER->>ENTRY: 提交任务与通信模式
    ENTRY->>ORCH: 创建 Task
    ORCH->>MEMORY: 关键词 / 标签检索

    opt structured + SemanticState
        ORCH->>STATE: 保存查询 NumPy 向量
        STATE-->>ORCH: state_id
        ORCH->>MEMORY: 向量相似度检索
    end
    MEMORY-->>ORCH: memory_id + summary

    ORCH->>REG: handshake + 能力发现
    REG-->>ORCH: task_planning → Planner
    ORCH->>PLAN: 原始任务 + 记忆摘要 + state_id
    PLAN->>LLM: 生成计划
    LLM-->>PLAN: TaskPlan
    PLAN-->>ORCH: 计划 / plan_ref

    ORCH->>REG: 发现 knowledge_retrieval
    REG-->>ORCH: Retriever
    ORCH->>RET: Planner → Retriever<br/>plan_ref + state_id
    RET->>LLM: 整理证据
    LLM-->>RET: EvidenceBundle
    RET-->>ORCH: 证据 / evidence_ref

    ORCH->>REG: 发现 safe_execution
    REG-->>ORCH: Executor
    ORCH->>EXEC: Retriever → Executor<br/>evidence_ref + state_id
    EXEC->>LLM: 生成执行结果
    LLM-->>EXEC: ExecutionResult
    EXEC-->>ORCH: 结果 / execution_ref

    ORCH->>REG: 发现 evidence_review
    REG-->>ORCH: Reviewer
    ORCH->>REV: Executor → Reviewer<br/>execution_ref + 证据 ID
    REV->>LLM: 审核输出
    LLM-->>REV: ReviewResult
    REV-->>ORCH: 审核结论 / review_ref

    opt Reviewer 确认可复用
        ORCH->>STATE: 保存记忆向量
        STATE-->>ORCH: memory state_id
        ORCH->>MEMORY: 写回成功经验
    end
    ORCH->>METRICS: 记录消息 / 字节 / 状态 / 命中 / 耗时
    ORCH-->>ENTRY: TaskResult
    ENTRY-->>USER: API / CLI / UI 输出

    Note over PLAN,REV: text 传完整文本；structured 传 schema、result_ref 与 state_id
